    "fizzle": {
      "word": "FIZZLE",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "text": "To make a hissing sound. It is the easfizzling. B. Jonson.",
          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        },
        {
          "text": "To make a ridiculous failure in an undertaking. [Colloq. or Low] To fizzle out, to burn with a hissing noise and then go out, like wet gunpowder; hence, to fail completely and ridicuously; to prove a failure. [Colloq.]",
          "partOfSpeech": "verb"
        },
        {
          "text": "A failure or abortive effort. [Colloq.]",
          "partOfSpeech": "noun"
        }
      ],
